br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/0ec3bc37a2fa56657f24165536d1137a.avif?t=1771277863\" width=616 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been hired by the bunker managers. It's your only chance. Don't screw it up or you'll be kicked out of the bunker. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/7de9571c54ccddb14266cd227ce81cef.avif?t=1771277863\" width=616 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/5fab205f3f0f16a5f2d1470fef5df9bd.avif?t=1771277863\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/49413ba66a1894f44427b273b5f221cb.avif?t=1771277863\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your job is to fix the problems of the bunkers and make sure they stand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/68833e6bab7456edec6b5f3d1326d1f7.avif?t=1771277863\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures are causing problems in the bunker. their life sources are becoming unusable, find them and make them work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780470/extras/4ef5041093dbe006bba02bf34076a996.poster.avif?t=1771277863\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat